BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20251020T070000Z
DTEND:20251022T180000Z
DTSTAMP:20260729T071244Z
UID:indico-event-47405@agenda.infn.it
URL:https://agenda.infn.it/event/47405/
CREATED:20250910T115554Z
DESCRIPTION:The main aim of the “Testing Quantum Foundations in the 2025 Qu
 antum Year” Workshop is to  bring forward an interdisciplinary and vibrant 
 dialogue between theoreticians and experimentalists\, in an informal and co
 llaborative environment\, around key questions in quantum physics\, in the 
 International Year of Quantum Science and Technology. Topics will range fro
 m foundational challenges\, such as the interplay between gravity and quant
 um mechanics\, collapse models\, and the spin-statistics connection\, to ne
 w experimental and theoretical approaches. Novel ideas and discoveries that
  explore and harness quantum effects in biological systems\, setting the gr
 ound for possible transformative applications at the intersection of physic
 s\, life sciences\, and technology\, will be discussed.\n \n\nChairs: Catal
 ina Curceanu (LNF-INFN)\nLocal Organizing Committee:\n \n \n.     \n\nhttps
 ://agenda.infn.it/event/47405/
LAST-MODIFIED:20250910T115728Z
LOCATION:Aula Salvini (Laboratori Nazionali di Frascati INFN)
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Testing Quantum Foundations in the 2025 Quantum Year
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20240124T133000Z
DTEND:20240124T143000Z
DTSTAMP:20260729T071244Z
UID:2sujn2jgc7orp3t7015c1abglm@google.com
CREATED:20240111T150837Z
