BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20251008T070000Z
DTEND:20251010T160000Z
DTSTAMP:20260729T071244Z
UID:indico-event-46442@agenda.infn.it
URL:https://agenda.infn.it/event/46442/
CREATED:20250718T083435Z
DESCRIPTION:Speakers: Dipali Basak\, Thomas William Chillery (Istituto Nazi
 onale di Fisica Nucleare)\, Riccardo Maria Gesuè (Istituto Nazionale di Fis
 ica Nucleare)\, Matthias Bernhard Junker (Istituto Nazionale di Fisica Nucl
 eare)\, Federico Ferraro (Istituto Nazionale di Fisica Nucleare)\n\nThe wor
 kshop "Perspectives at IBF" will be hosted by the Gran Sasso National Labor
 atory (LNGS) of INFN and will take place from Wednesday October 8 to Friday
  October 10\, 2025.\nThis workshop aims to bring together scientists intere
 sted in research at the deep underground Bellotti Ion Beam Facility (IBF)\,
  to explore opportunities and challenges in an international context and to
  stimulate networking.\n \n\nScientific Advisory Committee\n\nSandrine Cour
 tin\, University of Strasbourg\, France\nFederico Ferraro\, INFN-LNGS\, Ita
 ly\nAlba Formicola\, INFN-Roma 1\, Italy\nJordì Josè\, UPC Barcelona/IEEC\,
  Spain\nMatthias Junker\, INFN-LNGS\, Italy\nMatthias Laubenstein\, INFN-LN
 GS\, Italy\nMarcello Messina\, INFN-LNGS\, Italy\nValentino Rigato\, INFN-L
 NL\, Italy\nDaniel Robertson\, University of Notre Dame\, Indiana\, USA\n\n
 Local Organising Committee\n\nChair:  Federico Ferraro\, INFN-LNGS\, Italy\
 nDipali Basak\, INFN-LNGS\, Italy\nThomas Chillery\, INFN-LNGS\, Italy\nRic
 cardo Maria Gesuè\,  GSSI & INFN-LNGS\, Italy\n\nScientific Secretary\n\nFa
 usto Chiarizia\, INFN-LNGS\, Italy\n\n \n\nhttps://agenda.infn.it/event/464
 42/
LAST-MODIFIED:20250718T083511Z
LOCATION:Auditorium "E. Fermi" (LNGS)
SEQUENCE:0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
SUMMARY:Perspectives at IBF Workshop
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
